Package: com.stevenjc.ios6revival.appstore
Name: Revival App Store
Version: 0.0.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: App Store revival: removes the store's EV-certificate demand, accepts a store bag whose broken signature fails only when it came over verified https from apple.com (normal iOS trust checks still apply), and logs every App Store request to /var/mobile/Library/ios6revival/appstore-log.txt.
Maintainer: steve
Author: steve
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
